{"id":"c045448153929107","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination.md","title":"NFA–Epsilon-NFA Language Equivalence","display":"thm-nfa-epsilon-nfa-equivalence — NFA–Epsilon-NFA Language Equivalence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination","aliases":["73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination","73-thm-nfa-epsilon-nfa-equivalence"],"display":"thm-nfa-epsilon-nfa-equivalence — NFA–Epsilon-NFA Language Equivalence","depends_on":["[[73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction]]","[[73-df-epsilon-reachability]]","[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.5, print pp. 68–78; PDF pp. 90–100; local typed epsilon label","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§2.4, Theorem 2.2, pp. 24–28; local epsilon-elimination construction","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination</span><span>73-thm-nfa-epsilon-nfa-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nfa-epsilon-nfa-equivalence — NFA–Epsilon-NFA Language Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1eb4d9c48889960\" href=\"?note=a1eb4d9c48889960\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction\">73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4625243fc1dd8f0\" href=\"?note=f4625243fc1dd8f0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-reachability\">73-df-epsilon-reachability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4ab199feb1a8020\" href=\"?note=b4ab199feb1a8020\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-language-semantics\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d700ea676b35b73\" href=\"?note=1d700ea676b35b73\" title=\"73-df-nfa-language-semantics\">73-df-nfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.5, print pp. 68–78; PDF pp. 90–100; local typed epsilon label"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.4, Theorem 2.2, pp. 24–28; local epsilon-elimination construction"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；字母与有限词的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma},\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma},\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> and their accepted-language maps</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EClos}\">\\(\\operatorname{EClos}\\)</span> (epsilon closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f4625243fc1dd8f0\" href=\"?note=f4625243fc1dd8f0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-reachability\">73-df-epsilon-reachability</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>最后一个断言固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(E\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NoEps}\">\\(\\operatorname{NoEps}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a1eb4d9c48889960\" href=\"?note=a1eb4d9c48889960\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction\">73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left[\n\\exists E\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(E))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(N))\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left[\n\\exists E\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(E))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(N))\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(\\operatorname{NoEps}(E))=L(E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(\\operatorname{NoEps}(E))=L(E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Eliminate epsilon moves by setting\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta&#39;(q,a)=\\operatorname{EClos}(\\bigcup_{p\\in\\operatorname{EClos}(q)}\\delta(p,a))\">\\(\\delta&#39;(q,a)=\\operatorname{EClos}(\\bigcup_{p\\in\\operatorname{EClos}(q)}\\delta(p,a))\\)</span>\nand <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F&#39;=\\{q:\\operatorname{EClos}(q)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing\\}\">\\(F&#39;=\\{q:\\operatorname{EClos}(q)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The reverse direction assigns the empty set to every epsilon transition. Induction on input length proves both constructions preserve the language.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction","status":"resolved","id":"a1eb4d9c48889960","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"f4625243fc1dd8f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-reachability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"b4ab199feb1a8020","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"1d700ea676b35b73","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；字母与有限词的类型见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"f4625243fc1dd8f0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{EClos}$ (epsilon closure, see [[73-df-epsilon-reachability]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction","status":"resolved","id":"a1eb4d9c48889960","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"最后一个断言固定 $E\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}$，$\\operatorname{NoEps}$ 见 [[73-df-epsilon-elimination-construction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma},\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EClos}","display":false},{"tex":"E\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NoEps}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left[\n\\exists E\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(E))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(N))\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"L(\\operatorname{NoEps}(E))=L(E)","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta'(q,a)=\\operatorname{EClos}(\\bigcup_{p\\in\\operatorname{EClos}(q)}\\delta(p,a))","display":false},{"tex":"F'=\\{q:\\operatorname{EClos}(q)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2290,"backlinks":[{"id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination|NFA–Epsilon-NFA Language Equivalence]]"},{"id":"5a5b99309397a57a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fa5a4ce6b6982a00","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Thompson's structural construction maps each regular expression to an equivalent epsilon-NFA; [[73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination]] and [[73-thm-nfa-determinization]] then give a DFA."}],"outgoing":["a1eb4d9c48889960","f4625243fc1dd8f0","b4ab199feb1a8020","1d700ea676b35b73","0a6da8c909717780"]}